---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
---

<section class="relative bg-cuidaty-primary py-14 md:py-20 overflow-hidden" data-node-id="41:1678">
  <div class="container mx-auto px-4 md:px-6">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-10 lg:gap-16 items-center max-w-5xl mx-auto">

      <!-- Left: copy -->
      <div class="space-y-6">
        <p class="text-sm text-white/85 tracking-wide" data-node-id="40:1423">
          Para psicólogos e profissionais da saúde
        </p>
        <h2 class="text-white text-3xl md:text-[40px] font-bold leading-tight max-w-3xl" data-node-id="40:1422">
          O Cuidaty é o aliado que assume o trabalho administrativo para que o profissional possa focar no que é essencial: o paciente e a si mesmo.
        </h2>
        <div class="pt-2">
          <a
            href="#contato"
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-secondary hover:bg-secondary/90 text-white px-6 py-3 rounded-sm font-semibold text-sm transition-colors"
          >
            Experimentar a leveza no meu consultório.
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right: photo -->
      <div class="flex justify-center lg:justify-end">
        <div class="rounded-[40px] overflow-hidden max-w-[420px] w-full aspect-[1/1]" data-node-id="40:1453">
          <Image
            src="/psycologist-taking-coffe.jpg"
            alt="Profissional de saúde"
            class="w-full h-full object-cover"
            width={736}
            height={736}
            loading="lazy"
            format="webp"
            quality={88}
          />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
